<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebrute</book>
  <para style="h">Hebrute</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrute</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrute</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrute</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian, nidang lai a hun tuomtuom leh lam tuomtuom a guolneite tungtawn a ipu ipate kunga thu na genpa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam ni nukhiate ah a Tapa in eite kungah thu agenta hi, Ama pen sil zousie a gouluopa dingin aguot a, Ama tungtawn mama in leitung zong asiem hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen thupina vahpha leh Pasian lim leh mel ngelngel kilatna ahia, sil zousie asilbawltheina thuin atungdinga, Ama mama in ikhelnate asilsieng zou nuain, tunglam a thupipen ziet langah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vansawlsiengte sanga min hoizaw tham luopa ahi mabangin, amaute sanga min tungnungzaw tham ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vansawlsiengte koipen kungah ahiei Pasian in ana gen ngai; “Nang ka Tapa na hi a, Tuni’n ka hing hingkheta hi,” Ahisihleh, “Ama dingin Apa ka hi dinga, Ama ka Tapa ahi ding, ana chi ngel ei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaban ah, Pasian in a Tapa pieng masapen, leitunga ahing puilut lai in, “Pasian vansawlsiengte zousie in, Ama bie u’heh,” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsiengte tungtang thu ah “Aman a vansawlsiengte khu hui in abawl a, Ana semte zong meikuongin abawl hi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Tapa tungtang thu ah, “Aw Pasian, Na mangtoupha kumtawn, Kumtawn in a umden dinga, dihtatna leengchieng zong, Na leenggam leengchieng, ahi ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangman dihtatna Na it a, danbei a gamtatna na hua hi; Tuaziehin Pasian, Na Pasian in Nangpen, na lawmte tunga hing koi in, kipahna sathau ahing nuta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh, “Mangpa Nangma’n achiil in leitung, Kingapna suongphum na phumta a, tualeh vante zong na khutsuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate ahing mangthang ding ua, hinanleh Nang pen na umden ding hi; tuate zousie puonsil bangin ahing lui ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuate puonzal bangin na ziel dinga, akihengta ding uhi, Hinanleh, Nang pen angaingai in na umden a, Na kumte zong abei ngai sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh vansawlsiengte koi pen kungah ahiei, Pasian in, “Na melmate na keng ngapna a, ka bawl masangsie ka ziet langah tou in, achi ngai ei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vansawlsiengte zousie khu hundamna gouluo dingte nasep siengthou seppieh dinga sawldoh hagaute ahi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin ithu zahsate lunglut tah leh phatuom ngaitahin ingaisah sem ding uhi, tuachilouin ikinilmangsah kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen vansawlsiengte zanga thu kigente nangawn anakip a, bawsietna leh thumanlouna chintengin akituoh bang thuhna dihtah amu uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambang lawmlawm a hundam na thupi inahsah sih leh, bang ichi suotat vazuou diei? Tua hundamna thu khu achiil in Mangpa zanga gen masah ahia, athu zaten eite kungah asukip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian in zong chiemtenate, sillamdangte leh silmah tuomtuomte leh Hagau Siengthou silpiehte Ama deidan dungzuiin a theipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman atanchin igen uh, tunua chienga hing um ding leitung pen vansawlsiengte nuoi ah akoi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh koi ahiei khat in mun khat ah theipina thu ana gen chien hi: “Mihing bang ahi talawm a na lunggul, Mihing tapa zong bang ahita lawm a, hichi tuh a na ngaituo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ama vansawlsiengte sanga, nuoinung zaw deu in na bawla, thupina leh pahtawina na khusah a, na khut suohte tungah na koita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sil zousie athunuoi a um dinga, akeng nuoi ah akoi ziehin,” A nuoi a koilou bangma aum sih hi. Hinanleh tuin vang sil zousie a nuoi a kikoi in imu nai tadi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu pen Pasian hepina zieh a michin a dinga shina achep theina dinga vansawlsiengte sanga nuoinung zaw deu a, bawl tadi a um a, shina athuohna zieha thupina leh pahtawina khuhsah a umin imu zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama adinga sil zousie um a, Ama vang a sil bangkim umpa adingin ta tampite thupina a puilutpa leh amaute hundam na bawlpa thuohna zieh a suhbukim akilawm mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite siengthousahpa leh asienthousahte zousie Pa khat a kipan ahi ua, tuaziehin aman amaute unaute chi ding a zum pi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman, Ka unaute kungah, “Na min ka phuong dinga, Kikhawmte lah ah la sa in, ka hing phat ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh, “Ama ah hamuonna, ka koi ding” achi kia hi. Tualeh En un, “Tanah kei leh Pasian hing pieh, naupangte,” achi kia nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n naupangte pen tahsa leh sisan tangkhawm ahi zieh un, Ama mama in zong tuabangma ahing tang hi, shina zieh a; shina thuneipa diabol asuhmang theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh shi zau zieh a adamsung teng uh sal a taang zousie asuotatsah theina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman vansawlsiengte apanpi ahisih a, Abraham hahlesuonte panpi ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama pen Pasian nasep lam ah, mi khotuo thei leh gin um, Siempu Lien ahi theina ding leh mite khelna thuphatawina abawl theina dinga bangkim a, a unaute bangbanga bawl a ahing um khu Ama dingin akiphamaw mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama mama in zong solna tuoh a anathuoh taah ziehin solna tuohte khu apanpi thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin unau siengthou, van hatna tangte aw, ithugin uh, Sawltah leh Siempu lien Khrist Jesu khu ngaituo un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian innsung mite lah a Mosi agin um mabangin, Ama zong Ama guotpa kungah agin um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambang ahi ziehin inn sang lampain pahtawina thupizaw atan mabangin, Jesu’n Mosi sanga pahtawina thupizaw atan ding akilawm mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen inn chinteng mi koi ahiei khat in alam ahia, hinanleh sil zousie lampa pen Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi pen tunua chienga hing kigen ding thute theipipa ahia, Pasian innsung mite zousie lah ah suoh bangin, aginum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist pen Tapa bangin Ama innsung ngei ah agin um a hi, atawp donga i muonhuoina uleh ikinepna kipahna uh ituhdet pou uleh a innsung mite ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Hagau Siengthou gen banga, “Tunia a aw na zah u’leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />gamdai a ze etna nia ahel bangun, na lungtang uh khausah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuanah na pu na pate un, Kei hing ze et in ahing enkhie ua, kum sawmli sung ka silbawlte amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuami khangte tungah, ka lungthah a, alungtang un apampiel ua, ka lampite zong athei kha nawn sih uhi. Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka thangpaina a kihahsiel in, ka khawldamna ah na lut ngai sih ding uh,” ka chi hi, chia agen bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilvang un, unaute, tuachilouin Pasian hing apat pielmang dingin, na lah ua mi khat pou sungah ginlouna lungtang gilou ahing umkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh “Tuni” akichi lai in, khat leh khat kihanthawn tuo chiet zaw un, tuachilou in na lah ua mi khat pou khelna, solna a khausahin na umkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen iginna kipatna uh atawp donga ituhdet nah pouleh, Khrist a tanvou neite ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tunia a aw na zah u’leh, tua helna na bawl lai bang un, nalungtang uh khausah sih un,” chia akigen lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahileh za napi a hel teiteite koite ahiei? Mosi in Izipt gam a kipat a ahing puidohte zousie hilou uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh kum sawmli sung koite tunga lungthah ahiei? Sil bawlkhiel a gamdai a aluong uh lumte ahi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh thumang loute kung ahiloungal leh Akhawldamna ah alut sih ding uh chi a akichiemna koite kung hi ding ahiei leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n agintat lou zieh un alut theita sih uh chi imu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin zau vai, tuachilouin vang akhawldamna a lutna ding thuchiem umlai napiin na lah ua mi khattou achinglou bangin na umkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute kunga gen ahitaah bangin, eite kungah zong khantanhoi akigenta hi, hinanleh athu zahte uh, ginna toh akizoplou ziehin aphattuompi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ei agingtasate pen Akhawldamna ah ilut uhi, “Ka lungthahna a ka kichiem bangin, amaute khawldamna ah alut sih ding uhi,” Leitung kisiem chiila pata nnate, sep zou sieng hitama nanleh, chi a agen bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman heisung mun ahiei ah, ni sagi ni thu tambangin agen hi: “Pasian in ni sagi niin anasep zousie akipat akhawldamta hi,” achi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh, tam mun ah, “Ka khawldamna ah alut sih ding uh,” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi pawlkhat khawldamna a a lut ding uh thuchien a um nahlai zieh leh, ni danglai a khantanhoi kigenna masate thuman louna ziehin tua khawldamna ah alut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun sawttah nuain David zangin, “Tuni,” chiin bang ni ahiei khat aguot kia a. “Tunia a aw na zah u’leh, na lungtang uh khausah sih un, chia hun sawtpi a na kigen bangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joshua in amaute khawldamna na pie hitaleh, tuami nua in Pasian in ni dang khat thu agen nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian mite a dingin khawldamna khat a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian Anasepna apat akhawldam bangin, Ama khawldamna a lutte zong anasepte apat akhawlta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tua khawldamna a lut dingin phatuom ngaitahin ipang ding uh, tuachilouin pen mi khatyou tua thumanlouna etsahna banga umin ipua kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thu ahinga, sil abawl thei a, namsau alangni a tat tuo hiem sangin ahiem zaw a, hinna leh hagau, tuoleh gu kituona leh chintuigu khenthei khopin asun thei a, lungtang ngaituonate leh tupte akhen thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama mitmu ah silsiem khat zong phuolguh aum sih a; akunga itanchin itutna dingpa mitmu ah, bangkim saguoh leh kihongsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n vante a peisuoh Siempu Lien thupitah, Jesu Pasian Tapa inei ziehin, ithugin uh ipomdet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen ihat lounate hing lainatpilou Siempu Lien nei ihi sih a, eite mabanga lam chintenga solna tuohsa, hinapi khiel vawtlou Siempu Lien nei ihizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin khotuona itan theina ding u’leh itahsap hun chienga panpina dinga hepina imu theina dingun, hangsantahin hepina mangtoupha khu inai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siempu Lien mihingte lah a kipat a kiteldoh pouma khelnate zieha kithoina leh silpiehte lan dinga Pasian lam silte mihingte sihleh taanga lan dinga guot ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama zong hatlouna nei ahi ziehin bangma theiloute leh lampielte tungah khotuona anei thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamizieh main mipite khelnate kithoina alat chiengin, ama khelnate thoina zong alat akiphamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koiman tam pahtawina dinmun ama a dingin akimawh la thei sih a, Aaron banga Pasian hatte ahi loungal u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuamabangin Khrist in zong Siempu Lienpen a bawl dingin Amaleh Ama, kipahtawi ahi sih a, Ama kunga. “Nangpen ka Tapa na hia, tuni’n ka hing hingkhie hi,” chi a gen pa’n atawisang ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman mun tuom khat a, “Nangpen Melkizedek umdan banga, kumtawn a siempu na hi.” Chi a gen bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu tahsa a aumlai nitein shina akipat hundoh theipa kung ah nahpitah a kikou leh hitui luong pumin thungetnate leh thumnate alat nuain, Pasian zaudan asiem ziehin ngaikhieh in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tapa ahivangin athuohnate haw in thuman dan azilsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh suhbukim a hing umin, Athumangte zousie a dingin kumtawn a hundamna siempa ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melkizedek umdan banga Siempu Lien, Pasian chiin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama tungtang gen ding tampi ka nei ua, na ngaikhiet thasiet zieh un ahilchien zong ahasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahun lam ngaituoin, noute thuhil siete na hi taah ding uh ahi a, hinanleh Pasian thubulte hinghil tha kia dingin mi na poimaw nalai lai uhi. Ann gum hilou in nawitui na kiphamaw nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawitui ne poumate pen naungeh ahi nahlai ziehun, dihtatna thu ah theina bangma anei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh ann gum pen mi pichingte a ding ahia, angaituona uh zanga, sie leh pha khenthei dinga atheitheina uh sawizoite ading ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Khrist thubulte nuasiein, pichin lam manawna ding kikum zawta vai, nasep shisate apat kisianate, Pasian lam a ginnate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Baptisma tungtanga kithuhilnate, khut ngapna thute, mishi thawkiana thute, kumtawn thukhenna thuhilna thubulte phum kia nawn lou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian in pha asahleh tambang ibawl ngei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen khatvei suhvaah a umta a, vanlam silpiehte chiemta a, Hagau Siengthou tangta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian thuhoi leh hun hing tung dinga silbawltheinate chiemta napi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ginna apuamangsan u’leh pen, amaute kisia dinga bawltha thei guol ahi sih uhi, Pasian Tapa ama ua dinga khenbeh tha kia leh selphou ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei tungin guotui kezelte na dawn in, ama ua dinga lou nakihawte dinga, ante louhing hing piengsah in Pasian apat guolzawlna amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh lingkung leh loulingnei piengsah khu deilouin a um a, tualeh hamsedong phiel in a um hi, atawpna khu mei a hal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh ittahte aw, tambangin thu gennan u’leng zong, noute pen in tambang silte sanga hoizaw hundamna toh kithuo silte na bawl uh ka hing gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen na nasep u’leh, Amin zieh a itna na sulatte u’leh, misiengthoute nna nasep pieh uh, tutan a zong nasep zing uh, manghil dingin Pasian adihtatlou ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh noute koipou in, kinepna theichienna kim tang dingin, atawpdongin thanopsuo chiet u’lachin ka hing dei mama uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachia na thasiet sih ua, ginna leh kukalna zieh a thuchiem gouluo mite umdan zuite na hi uh, ka hing dei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasian in Abraham kunga thuchiem abawl lai in, Ama sanga lienzaw a akichiem theilou ziehin Ama leh Amain akichiem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Pellou in nang ka hingguolzawl ngeingei dinga, tualeh pun zong ka hing pungsah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachia Abraham in kukal taha athuohzou nua in, thuchiem amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihingte pen amaute sanga lienzaw min louin akichiem ua, tualeh thu namdetna ding a kihahsielna in kinielna zousie tawpna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tambangin Pasian in alungtup kiheng theilou ahi dan thuchiem gouluo dingte kungah kichientaha latsah ut in, kihahsielnain asukipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua khu Pasian zuouthei ahilouna kiheng kia theilou sil nite pansan a kihumbitna ding sui a taizah eiten imasanga kinepna kikoi tudet dinga hanthawnna nasatah ineina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua kinepna pen hinna sia ka kip in inei a, muonhuoi leh kiptah ahi, tuakhu puonzah sung mun siengthoupen Pasian umna ah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua mun siengthoupen ah, Jesu Melkizedek umdan banga kumtawn a Siempu Lien hi ding in eite makai in ana lut masata hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam Melkizedek pen, Salem leengpa, Pasian Tungnungpen Siempu ahia, Abraham in leengte ava ban tha zou a ahing kinuale kia lai in Melkizedek in ana dawna, ana guolzawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Abraham in Ama kungah anei zousie sawma khat apie hi; amasapenin amin khiehna khu dihtatna leengpa, tua ban ah Salem leengpa, tua pen lemna leengpa china ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen pa neilou, nu neilou, khanggui neilou, umpat ni neilou, hintawp neilou, hinanleh Pasian Tapa banga bawl, tawp ni neilou siempu a umden ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin chihapa Abraham ngel in agallah vante sawma khat apiehnapa, tam mipa thupidan ngaituo di ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Levi hahlesuon siempu nasepna tang poumain, dan dungzuiin mite lah a kipat sawm a khat lah ding thupieh amu uhi, chi pen a unaute lah ua pat ahi, Abraham khaal a pieng hinan uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ama ua kipata khanggui sut tela umkhaloupain Abraham apat sawma khat ala a, thuchiem neipa khu aguolzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aneuzaw khu alienzawin aguolzawl ahi chi nielguollou a dih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tana kigenna ah ashi thei mihingten sawma khat atang ua, hinanleh khunah pen ama ahing zing hi chia atanchin theisah a umpa’n atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sawma khat tangpa Levi nangawn in zong Abraham tungtawn in sawma khat apie hi, chi thei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Melkizedek in Abraham ava lamdot lai in, Levi pen ama suongpa Abraham khaal ah a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Levite siempu hina-a bukimna mu thei hitaleh, (aziehpen tami nuoi ah miten danthu ana mu uhi) Aaron umdan bang kichi louin, Melkizedek umdan bang nei siempu dang ahing um ding akiphatmawna bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen siempu hina ahing kihen tah chiengin dan zong ahing kihen akiphamawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin Ama tambanga atungtang thu na kigennapa pen nam tuom mi ahi a, tua nam a kipat koima maitama nasem aum ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen i Mangpa u’khu Juda nam a pat hing pieng ahi chi akichien mama hi, tua nam tungtang ah Mosi in siempu lam thu bangma agen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Melkizedek umdan bang siempu dang khat ahing um ziehin, ka thugen uh akichien semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama pen tahsa dan thupieh banga siempu hing hi ahi sih a, hinanleh hintawp neilou silbawltheina a siempu hing hi ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen: “Nangpen Melkizedek umdan bang nei kumtawn a siempu na hi chiin atheisahta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu khat ah tua dan thupieh masa pen, hatlou leh phattuomnabei ahi ziehin tuomkhin in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen dan in bangma abukimsah theisih a, alangkhat ah, kinepna hoizaw ahing polut a, tuami ziehin eiten Pasian inai uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam pen kihahsielna lou a siempu a bawl ahi lou zieh in, Ama khu siempu a bawl ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen tua siempute khu kihahsielna tellou a siempu a siem ahi ua, hinanleh Ama pen akungah “Mangpa akihahsiel a, alunghei kia sih ding hi, Nang pen Melkizedek umdan banga, Kumtawn a siempu na hi, chi a gentu kihahsielna toh siempu hing hi a hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuamabangin Jesu khu thuhun hoizaw kipsahpa ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siempu tampi ana umta uhi, amaute pen shi na in adal ziehin, koima apangden thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu pen kumtawn a hingden ahiziehin akihengtheilou siempu hina anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama tungtawn a Pasian kunga hing peite thunget pieh dinga hing zing ahizieh in, atawp dongin ahundam thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tambang Siempu lien, itulmawte hing bawlpieh thei, inei uh eite a dingin akilawm mawng ahi, Ama pen misiengthou, nuolnabei, nieh banglou leh mikhielte lah akipata kikoituom, vante sanga sangzaw a tawisanga umpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama pen tua siempu Lien dangte banga nichin a ama khelnate thoina lan masa phot a tuazou chieng a, mite khelnate zieha alat angai sih hi, Tami ziehin Ama leh Ama akilat lai in ngamden dingin khat vei in ana lanzouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen dan in mihing hatlouna neite siempu hi dingin aguot a, hinanleh kihahsielna thu, dan nua a hing um in, Tapa kumtawn a dinga suhbukimsa pen a guot zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin ithugen laigil pen tami ahi: Vantunga thupina Mangtoupha zietlam a toupa, tambang Siempu lien nei ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama mihingte bawl hilou, Mangpa tunding mun siengthou leh biehbuh dihtah a nasempa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen siempu lien pouma silpiehte leh kithoi nate lan dinga guot ahi ua, tuaziehin tam siempu lien in zong lat ding bang ahiei khat anei akiphamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama leitunga um na hita leh pen siempu ahi sih ding hi, aziehpen dan dungzui a silpiehte lan ding siempute ana umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siemputen munsiengthou a anasep uh pen van silte etsahna lim leh him ahibou hi. Mosi in biehbuh bawl dinga akisah lai a, Pasian in athuhil bangin, “Aman muoltunga na kunga etton dinga ka hing musah dungzui a silzousie na bawl dingin pilvangin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin thuchiem hoizawte tunga kibulphu thuhun hoizawsem palai ahimabangin, nasepna hoizaw ana tangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua thuhun masapen adihlouna umlou ana hita leh, thuhun nina mun ding sui ngailou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in amaute khelna mu in tambang in agen hi: “Ngai un, Israel innkuonte leh, Juda innkuonte toh thuhuntha ka bawl hun ding nite, hing tung ding ahita. Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Apu leh pate uh Izipt gam a kipat, puidoh dinga abantaang ua, ka kaidoh ni a, akung ua ka thuhun pen bang hilou, aziehpen amaute ka thuhun ah, a umden sih ua, tualeh ken amaute ka ngaisah sih hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen tua nite nua chieng a, Israel innkuonte kunga, ka thuhun ding khu tami ahi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Alungsim uah ka dan thupiehte, ka koi dinga, alungtang uah ka giel ding hi, tualeh ama ua ding in, a Pasian uh ka hi dinga, amaute pen Kei a dingin, Ka mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaute koiman a innvengte u’leh, aunaute u’kungah, Mangpa thei in chi’n athuhil nawn sih ding hi, Aziehpen aneupen apat alien pen dongin, Kei ahing theita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen adihtatlounate uah ka khotuo dinga, akhelnate u’leh danbei a agamtatnate uh, ka thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman thuhuntha chia agen ziehin, amasapen aluisahta hi. Tuachi’n lui a ahing upata khu amang ding mawng ahita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n thuhun masapen in zong Pasian nasepna dante leh tam leitung munsiengthoute anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biehbuh khat akibawl a, dantan masa pen ah meivah tunna leh dawkan leh atunga lat siengthousa tanghou kikoite a um hi, tami dantan pen mun siengthou akichi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh puonzah nina ban ah Munsiengthoupen kichi biehbuh khu a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua munsiengthoupen sungah, gimnamtui halna sana maitam leh sana tui a kiluonkhum thuhun singkuong, asunga mana umna sana bel leh Aaron chiengsel, tualeh Thuhun suongpehte a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua singkuong tungah, thupina cherubimte a um ua, tuate’n aha un, khotuona Mangtoupha lie in azahkhum uhi. Tamte tungtang thu tuin kimtah in igen thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambanga silzousie guot zou dimdiam ahi chiengin, biehbuh dantan masa sungah siempute nasem dingin alut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh dantan nina ah pen, Siempu lien maimai kum khat in khat vei alut a, tua zong ama khelnate leh mite khelnate thoina dinga alat ding sisan tawi in alut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hagau Siengthou in tami ahing theisah hi: biehbuh masa pen adin laisie, munsiengthoupen a lutna lampi akihong nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tampen tulai hun etsahna ahia, tuanah sie leh pha theina lam thu a, abemite hoi bukimsah theilou silpiehte leh kithoinate alaan zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua sillatte pen neh leh dawnte, kisuhsiengna tuomtuom leh tahsalam dante giap ahi a, kisiemphat kia hun hing tun masangsie a zah dinga bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist khu sil hoi hing um dingte Siempu Lienpen ding a hing pei in, biehbuh thupizaw leh, bukimzaw mihing khut a lam hilou ah, tua pen tam silsiemte lah a ahi sih, china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kelte leh bawngnoute sisan hilou in Ama ngel sisan a eite dinga kumtawn a tatkhietna muin munsiengthou ah ngamden dingin khatvei bep alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawngtalte leh kelte sisan leh bawngla vutvamte, mi siengloute tunga thein bawn tahsa siengsah khop a asuhsieng thei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist, kumtawn Hagau zieh a genbanglou a Pasian kunga kilan sisan in, Pasian hing nasem dingin, nasep shisa apat in na sie leh pha theina uh, bangchituhin asusiengthouta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami ziehin Ama khu thuhuntha palai ahi, thuhun masa nuoia tatkhelnate lah a pat a tatdohna dinga ashi taah ziehin hatten kumtawn a gouluo ding thuchiem khu atang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thugousie umna phot ah, athugousiepa shina zong aum ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen tua thugousie pen athugousiepa ashi nua chiengin akizang thei pan a, thugousiepa hin laisie thu anei mawngmawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin thuhun masa zong sisan panglou a lat hilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi in dan dungzui a thupieh pouma mipite zousie kunga aphuondoh zouin, bawngnoute leh kelte sisan, tui toh, sawnsan toh, hissop toh ala a, laibu ziel leh mipite zousie athe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tami Pasian in na kung ua ahing pieh thuhun sisan khu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuamabangin aman biehbuh leh nasepna a kizang um leh bel zousiete sisan athe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh dan dungzuiin sil zousie chiphiel dingte sisan a suhsiengthou in aum a, sisan suolouin ngaidamna manwgmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin Van a sil umte kibatpite tambang kithoinate a suhsiengthou ding mawng ahi, hinanleh vanlam sil dihtahte pen tamte sanga hoizaw kithoinate a suhsiengthou a um ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist khu khuta bawl munsiengthou ah alut sih a, tua pen atahtah kibatpi giap ahi, hinanleh tuin Pasian mai ah, eite taanga kilang dingin van ah alut zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu lien kum chin a ama sisan hilou, sisan dang tawi a, munsiengthoua alut zel bangin Ama pen ama leh ama kilan dingin alut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabang na hisihleh leitung siemchil apat tampi vei athuohta ding hi, hinanleh tu huntawp ah, Ama pen khelna suhbeina dinga ama leh ama hing kilan in khat vei ahing kilangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihinga dingin khatvei shi guotsa ahi a, tuazou chiengin thukhenna um ding ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Khrist khu mi tampite khelna pomang dingin khatvei lat in a umta hi. Tualeh Ama na ngahte kungah khelna tel louin hundam na mu dingin aniveina dingin ahing kilang kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dan pen sil hoi hing tung dingte lim giap ahia, akibahpite tahtah ahilou ziehin, kum chin a kithoina alat zelzelte un, ahing naite abukimsah thei ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi na hisihleh sillatte na tawpta lou ding ahi uoi mah? Aziehpen abemite khatvei suhsiengthou a um in khiel kiphawhna anei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh tua kithoinate ah kum chin a khelna kiphawhdoh kiana a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen bawngtalte leh kelte sisan in khelnate lamang thei guol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin leitunga ahing pei lai in Aman: Kithoina leh sillat na lunggul sih a, Kei a dingin tahsapum khat, na hing bawlpiehzawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Halmang sillatte leh khel na, kithoinate ah kipahna, na nei sih hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken, Ngai in, laibuziel ah keima thu akigiel hi, Na deilam bawl dingin ka hing pei hi, Aw Pasian, ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atungah, “Kithoina leh sillat, halmang sillatte leh khelna sillatte na dei sih a, ama uah kipahna zong na nei sih hi, Tuate khu dan dungzuia kilan ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Ngai in, Na deilam bawl dingin ka hing pei hi,” Aw Pasian, achi hi. Anina atunding theina dingin, amasapen khu alamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama dei banga Jesu Khrist tahsapum setden dinga lat ahi ziehin eite suhsieng thouin iumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh siempu chin in nichin a nasem in khelnate lamang theilou kithoina ngaima lan tha zel in ading zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman kumtawn a ngamden dinga khelnate dinga kithoina khat alat nua in, Pasian ziet lam ah atouta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hun akipat amelmate akeng ngapna a bawl ahimasangsie uh ngah in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman sillat khat in asuhsiengthousate kumtawn a dingin asubukimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Hagau Siengthou in zong eite kungah ahing theisah hi; aziehpen Aman:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tua nite nua chiengin amaute toh, ka bawl ding ka thuhun tami ahi,” Mangpa’n achi hi. Alungtang uah ka danthute ka koi dinga, alungsim uah ka giel nalai ding hi, achi zou nua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaban ah, “Akhelnate u’leh danbei a, agamtatnate uh, ka thei ngitnget nawn sih ding hi,” achi be nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tambanga khelnate ngaidamna umna phot ah khelna ding sillatte a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuazieh in unaute Jesu sisan zieh a mun Siengthoupen lut ngamna hansanna nei in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite dinga ahing bawlpieh lampi tha leh hing ah puongzah (tua khu Ama tahsa pumpi china ahi) kaantanin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian innkuonpite tunga Siempu lien khat inei zieh un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sie leh pha theina hoilou apat ilungtangte uh siengthou a umin isapum u’zong tui chiima silsienga um in, tualeh ginna theichienna lungtang dihtah toh, Pasian inai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I kinepna thugin uh kilohlouin kiptah in tudet va ui, Ama thuchiem hing pepa a muonhuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh itna leh sil hoi bawlna lamah kithathousah dingin khat leh khat iki awlmawtuo chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte bangin ikikhopnate uh tawpsan sih vai, hinanleh khat leh khat kihantawh tuo zaw vai, tualeh ni a hing naita chi na thei zieh un kihantawh tuo semsem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen thutah theina inei nua ua, thei gehguh a ikhel teitei u’leh pen, khelnate dinga kithoina mawngmawng a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahing tung ngeingei ding thukhenna zauhuoi leh Pasian melmate katum ding Pasian lungthahna meikuong aum zawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosi dan nuol mi pouma, theipimi ni ahiei, thum ahieite theipina ziehin, khotuona umlou keiin ashi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasian Tapa akeng nuoi a tuonden a, thuhun sisan ama suhsiengthouna khu silsienglou banga ngaisut mi leh hepina Hagau Siengthou simmawbawl mi khu bangchituh a gawtna huoise zaw thuoh leh kilawm in na tuot uoi le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen “Phuba mawngmawng keima lah ding ahi;” Keima’n ka thuh ding hi, Mangpa’n achi, chi leh, “Mangpa’n amite thu akhenpieh ding chia genpa ama ithei uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian hing khut a pua khah khu sil zauhuoi tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh masang lai a, suhvah a na um nua ua, thuohna hasatahte na thuoh lai nite uh ngaituo kia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khatvei tengin mipi mai ah simmawna leh bawlsietnate thuohin na um ua, khatvei tengin tuabanga suhgenthei a umte thuohpite na hing hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aziehpen Keima mama zong sia khainieng kolbuna ka umlai in van a gou hoizaw leh umden ding na nei uh chi na thei zieh un, nouten na hing lainat ua, miten nanei nalam uh ahing lahpieh lai un kipahtahin na thuoh uhi; ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kimuonna uh paimang sih un, tami’n kipahman thupitah hing musah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian deilam na bawl nua ua, thuchiem na nga theina dingun, na kukal uh akiphamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen, “Tomnou kaal in, ahing pei dingpa, ahing pei dinga, sawt hal nawnlou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Midih khu ginna in ahing dinga, hinanleh anuatol leh pen, ka lungsim in ama ah, kipahna anei sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh eite pen mangthai dinga nuatolte lah a pang ihi sih ua, hinna humbit dinga gingtate lah a mi ihi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ginna pen ikinepna silte theichienna, silmuloute theichienna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam ginna ziehin ahi, nidanglai upaten phat ana law uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ginna zieh a leitungte Pasian thu a lepkhawm ahi a, akimu thei silte zong, akilangthei silte a siem ahi sih chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ginnain Abel in Kain sangin kithoina hoizaw Pasian kungah alan a, tuami ziehin ama midihtat ahi chi theipina alaw hi, Pasian in asilpiehte athei a, tuakhu ziehin ama shita napiin, tua ginna ziehin thu agen nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ginnain Enok khu shina mulou dingin lahmangin a um a, Pasian in alahmang ziehin muin aum nawnta sih hi, lahmanga aum masangin Pasian alungkim sah hi chi theisahna anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ginna panglouin Pasian lungkim sah thei guol ahi sih hi, aziehpen Pasian kunga hing pei mi in, Ama a um tahtah na hi, chi leh Ama kukal taha suimite kunga nuomman pepa ahi chi, gintat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ginnain Noah in sil mu nailoute thua Pasian vauhil a aum lai in, zauna siengthou neiin, ainnkuonpite hundamna dingin, kuong abawl a, tami ziehin aman leitung siemmaw atangsahta-a, ginna zieha um dihtatna gouluopa ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ginnain Abraham khu anua chienga ahing luo ding gam a pei dinga hat a a um lai in athumanga, tualeh apeina ding mun theilou hinapi, apeidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ginna in gam chiem ah, gamdanga khuolzin taam bangin ana taam den a, thuchiem kibanga agouluopi dingte, Isaak leh Jakob toh puon inn ah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen aman suongphum dettah nei Pasian lam leh bawl khopi khu angah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ginnain Sarah in zong naupai theina anei a, achiempa khu, muonhuoi asah ziehin atehnua in ta anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin ashisa toh kibang mi khat akipat in van a aasite banga tam leh tuipi pieu a senel simsenglou banga tam hahlesuonte ahing pieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam mite pen ginna nei in ashi siengta ua, thuchiem tang zoulou in, hinanleh gamlatah akipat galmuin amuong ngam ua, apomkip ua, leitung ah vang mikhuol leh khuolzin taambang giap ihi chi aphuong ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tambang thugenmiten ama-ua ding gam khat lunggul in asui uh chi akilangsah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh adihtahin amauten ahing pawtdohna gam uh lunggul kia hi u’leh pen, kinuale kiana ding hun lemtang ana mu tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh gam hoizaw lunggul ana hi ua, tua khu van gam ahi. Tuaziehin Pasian khu a Pasian uh chi a hat ding azum sih hi, aziehpen ama ua dingin khopi khat bawlsa’n akoipiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ginna in Abraham ze et a aum laiin Isaak alan hi, thuchiemte tangpa’n atapa neisun alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Isaak ah na hahlesuonte akichi ding, chipa ngel khu,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian in mishi lah akipat in akaithou thei hi chia geel in; khuna kipat in etsahnain mu zong amu kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gin na in Isaak in sil hing tung dingte thu ah Jakob leh Esau aguolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gin na in Jakob in ashi kuon in, Joseph tate gel aguolzawl a, achiengkhut dawn a kingam in Pasian abie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gin na in Joseph in ashi ding kuon in, Israel tate pawtdoh ding thu agen a, tualeh agute tungtangah thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gin na in Mosi apien lai in, naungeh melhoi tah ahi achi zieh un, ha thum sung anu leh apa phuol in a uma leengpa thupieh zong azau sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ginna in Mosi in ahing pichin nuain, Pharaoh tanu tapa chi a um ding a ut sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hun tomkhat sung khelna nopsahnate man sang in, Pasian mite toh bawlgentheina thuoh atel zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khrist thuohgimnate khu Izipt gam hausatnate sanga hausatna thupizaw a ngai in, akipahman mu ding lam khu a en zing zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ginna in aman leengpa lungthahna zaulouin Izipt gam anuasie a; mutheiloupa khu amu ziehin athuoh teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ginna in aman peikan pawi leh sisan thena abawla, ta masa mangthaisahpa’n amaute akhoikhah louna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ginna in amauten leigaw tunga peibangin Tuipi san akaan ua; Izipt miten zong tuabanga bawl atum ua, tui ah atumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ginna in Jeriko kulbaang khu ni sagi sung akimvelnua un, achimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ginnain kizuanu Rahab zong ginglou mite toh amangthai khawm sih hi, aman enkhe mite lungmuongtah a azintun zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh bang ka gen nalai diei le? Gideon leh Barak, Samson leh Jephthah, tualeh David leh Samuel leh guolneite thute gen ding chileng hun in ahing dai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuate’n ginnain leenggamte azou ua, dihtatna abawlkhie ua, thuchiemte atang ua, humpibahnei kam achiipieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meikuong thahatna asudai ua, namsau hiemte apel ua, hatlouna akipat in hatsahin a um ua, galdouna phuol ah ahat mama ua, gamdang galkap honte adelzah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Numeiten amishite uh hinga thoukia amu uhi. Tualeh midangten bawlsietna athuoh ua, thawkiana hoizaw amuna dingun, hakhiet a um a ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Midangten nuizat bawlna leh chienga jepnate athuoh nalai uhi, ahi, sia khainieng a hen leh suongkul nangawn a khum in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Suanga sein aum ua, sing-at a attan in a um ua, ze etna athuoh ua, namsau a satlupin a um uhi. Amaute belam vun leh kel vunte silin, tahsapna leh bawlsietna leh gawtna huoisetahte thuohin avahvai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amaute dingin leitung umna taah ahi sih a, gamdai gamgawte, muoltungte, ah avahvai ua, kawlhawmte leh leikohawmte ah ateng kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tam mite zousie in aginna zieh ua, phat ana law vang un thuchiem atang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aziehpen eite tellou a amaute suhbukima aum louna dingin, Pasian in eite dingin sil hoizaw khat guotsain akoi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin eite zong hichi khop a theipimi meipi thupitah im kimkot a i um uh thei in, ahing nohsah zousie leh khelna eima a behdente hemkhedoh vai in imasang ua taikidemna ah kukaltahin itai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I ginna siempa leh subukimpa Jesu lam en in, Aman amasanga um kipahna ziehin zumnate zong khohsa lou in Kross ah gimna athuoh a, Pasian mangtoupha zietlam ah ava touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungsim ua na tawl ua, na lungkieh louna dingun, Ama tunga mikhielte tatsietna thuohpa khu ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute sisan luong khop hiela khelna douin na pang nai tadi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hanthawnna thu tate kihilna banga na kung ua kigen khu na manghilta uhi; “Ka ta, Mangpa thununna ngaidau sinlen, Phawh hil a na um chiengin zong, lungke sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n a itte athunun a, ta banga apomte pouma ajep zel hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thununna na thuoh u’leh, Pasian in atate bangin ahing bawl ahi, aziehpen pa thununlou ta koi aum ngai ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thununna na thuohlou na hi u’leh zawlta, na hi ua, ta tahtah na hi sih uhi, ta tahtah poumain thununna athuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaban ah eite hing siemhoi tahsa a pate inei uhi, tualeh amaute izatat uhi, tuasanga Hagau lam Pa thua i um zawh sem ua, ihin ding uh hizawlou ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I pate’n amaute hoisah bangin, bakhat sung ahing thunun uhi, hinanleh Aman eite phattuomna dinga, sienthouna itan theina dingin, ahing thunun zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thunun na khat poupou pen aki thuoh laitahin kipah huoi in alang sih a, hasiet huoi in alang zaw hi, ahivangin anua chiengin, tuabanga thununna nuoia kituoinemte dingin, ga lungmuon huoi, dihtatna asuo zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin khut kaikhete leh khupzoite khausah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh na kengte ua dingin lampi tang siem un, tuachia kengbaite akihiehloi louna ding in damsah zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zousie toh kilemna leh siengthouna del un, tua siengthouna louin Koiman Mangpa amu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pilvangtah in en un, tuachilouin mi khattou Pasian hepina tangzoulou na um kha ding ua, “Khatna hui khat hing mengdohin,” tuami’n mi tampite suhbuain a um kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koima numei pasal kaal a athangtat louna dingin pilvangun, tuachilouin Esau in a uzaw hina hamphatna ann neh khat a azua bangin, Pasian zatatlou khat a um kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anualam in Esau in guolzawlna gou khu luo tumin, hitui luong pumin phatuomngai tahin sui nanleh kisiana ding mun amulou ziehin nuolin a umta chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen noute pen muol khoikhah thei leh mei a kaa leh, vomna leh mielna tualeh huipi lanna mun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh pengkul ginna leh thugen aw ging zaten azau ua, amaute kunga thu gen nawnlou dinga angetna mun uh, tua muol hing tungzong na hi nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tua muol pen ganta nangawnin asuhkhahle suonga selup ding ahisihleh thaltanga kaplup ding ahi chia thupieh khu amauten athuoh zouta sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua asilmu ukhu azauhuoi mama a, Mosi in “Ka zau sengseng a ka kithing vawt hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen Zion taang leh Pasian hing khopi van Jerusalem, sim senglou vansawlsieng honpi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawmpi lien leh van a min kigiel ta pieng masa hattuom kung leh mi zousie vaihawmpa Pasian kung leh midihtat suhbukim a umte hagau kung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tualeh thuhuntha palai Jesu kung leh Abel a sanga sil hoizaw gen sisan thepa kunga hing tung na hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua thugenpa na nuol khah louna ding un pilvangun, aziehpen leitunga thugenpa anuol ua bawn suohtalou ahi u’leh, van a kipat a thu hing pepa ikiheisan u’leh isuohta maw sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hun lai in A aw in leitung akiling sah a, hinanleh “Tuin Aman leitung guoh hilouin van zong khatvei lingsah kia nalai ding ka hi,” chiin thu achiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam thu “Khatvei” ka kilingsah kia ding achi pen, akiling loute a umden thei na ding a, akiling te khu silsiemte bang a suonmangin a um ding chi atheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin suhling guollou leenggam itan ziehun, zatatna toh, Pasian zaudan siem kawm a pomtah taha, Pasian nna iseptheina dingun, hepina inei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen i Pasian u’khu ahing katum thei meikuong ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unau ki it tuona um ngitngetta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mikhuolte hoibawl ding manghil sih un, tuabanga bawl in mi pawlkhatten theilou kaal in vansawlsiengte ana zintun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suongkul taangte khu, amaute toh taangkhawm banga kingaisutin thei ngitnget un, tualeh bawlsietna thuohte zong tahsa pumkhat na hiziehun thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zousie lah ah kitenna zatatin um henlen, tualeh lupna zong suhbua louin um heh, aziehpen numei pasal kaal a thangtatte leh angkawmte tung ah Pasian in thukhenna abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hinkhuo uh sum deigawna apat kem unlen, na nei teng tung uah lungkim un. Aziehpen Pasian in “Ka hing nuasie sih dinga, Kang taisan ngai sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin hangsantah in, “Mangpa kei hing panpipa ahia, Ka zau sih ding hi, mihingin kei bang ang law thei diei,” i chi ngam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kung ua Pasian thugen, na lamkaite uh thei ngitnget un; a umdan ua kipat a sil hing umdohte ngaituo unlen, a ginna uh zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Khrist khu, zani tuni leh tangtawn in angaingai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thugin tuomtuom leh kithuhilna lamdangte puimangin um sih un. Aziehpen lungtang hepina a suhkip ahoi ahi; neh leh taah a suhkip ding ahi sih, tuabang a lungkhamten tuate ah phattuomna amu tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biehbuh a nasemten aneh theilouna uh maitam khat inei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siempu lien in khelna thoina dinga munsiengthou sungah gantate sisan atawilut zel a, aluongte pen giehphuol pulam ah akihaltum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n zong Ama sisan mama a mite asuhsieng theina dingin kulpi kotpi pulam ah athuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama a sim mawna uh puoin giehphuol pulam ah Ama kungah pei va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen tamnah khopi det leh umden ding inei sih a, ahing um ding khopi lunggul in isui zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama vangin Pasian kungah phatna kithoina sillat tawplouin ilan ding uhi, tua khu amin a ikipahna phuondohna kamte ga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh sil hoi bawl leh na neisa uh mite hop ding manghil sih un, aziehpen tuabang kithoina sillatte ah Pasian akipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tung ua vaihawm lamkaite thu mang unlen, athunuoi uah lut un, aziehpen noute hing kem a, na hinna uh hing venpiehte ahi uhi, tuapen lunggimtaha bawllouin, lungnuomtahin bawlzaw u’heh, lunggimtah a abawl u’khu nou a dingin aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koute dingin thu hing ngetpieh un, sil zousie ah pahtat huoitah a hin ding lunggul in sie leh pha theina hoitah ka nei uh, chi ka kigingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh akinthei lam a na kung ua sawl kia a ka um theina dingin, adieh in ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin lungmuonna Pasian, i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist mishi lah a kipata kaithoupa, kumtawn thuhunna sisan zieh a Belampu thupitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu Khrist zala Ama mitmu a adeilam bawl dingin noute sil hoi chintengin hing subukim hen, Ama kungah kumtawn kumtawnin thupina umdenta hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unaute aw ka hing hanthawnna thute na thuoh teitei, dingin kahing ngen hi, aziehpen, na kung uah thu tomnoukhat in ka hing giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I unaupa uh Timothi akihadohta china thei uh, ka dei hi, ama ahing tun baileh ama toh noute mu dingin ka hing haw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na tung ua vaihawm lamkaite zousie leh misiengthoute zousie mangpha ka hah hi hing na gen piehun. Itali gama umten mangpha ahing hah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Noute zousie kungah hepina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
